<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan financial markets to close on May 1.</title>
<headline>Taiwan financial markets to close on May 1.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's banking institutions and financial markets will close on May 1 for Labour Day, the finance ministry announced in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>They will resume operations on May 2.</p>
<p>-- Taipei newsroom (5080815)</p>
</text>
